[{"id":165523984,"discussion_id":"7b06ef22fce374c2ec5132c14cf109fda483172d","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在修复`grid_sampler3_d_grad`算子在特定条件下的Tiling策略误用问题。原代码在输入数据类型为`DT_FLOAT`且确定性计算模式开启时，会无条件地将Tiling Key设置为4。此逻辑可能导致该优化策略在不支持的硬件架构上被错误应用，影响兼容性和性能。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案是在原有的条件判断中增加对硬件架构的检查。具体而言，在`tiling4GridSampler3DGradTiling`函数中，现在仅当同时满足“输入数据类型为`ge::DT_FLOAT`”、“确定性计算模式开启”以及“编译信息`compileInfo`中的`isDavid`标志为真”这三个条件时，才会调用`tilingContext->SetTilingKey(4)`。这确保了该特定的Tiling策略（Key=4）被精确限定在David架构下的确定性浮点计算场景中使用，提高了代码的精确性和硬件兼容性。","created_at":"2026-03-17T17:05:36+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-17T17:05:36+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165524002,"discussion_id":"a7b0cb3f46d5911dce047113fd42de4400cb0939","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-basic/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| image/grid_sample | ✅ [*gubaocheng*](https://gitcode.com/gubaocheng), [*liu-wei*](https://gitcode.com/liu-wei) (2/2) | ✅ [*gubaocheng*](https://gitcode.com/gubaocheng) (1/1) |\n| image/resize_bilinear_v2 | ✅ [*gubaocheng*](https://gitcode.com/gubaocheng), [*liu-we